OL,3,GNEWSAShopkeepers fight back against
OL,4,A'trolley gangs'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA perfume shop manager who tackled
OL,7,Fshoplifters to the ground is now
OL,8,Fhelping other businesses protect
OL,9,Fthemselves from "trolley gangs"
OL,10,Ftargeting shops across her town.
OL,12,FDomonique Woodward, who runs Fragrance
OL,13,FHouse, in Malvern, Worcestershire, was
OL,14,Fpunched in 2023 as she tried to stop
OL,15,Fmen stealing more than #1,000 worth of
OL,16,Fstock.
OL,18,FShe recalled seeing bags coming out
OL,19,Ffrom underneath the thieves' T-shirts
OL,20,Fas they began ''swooping full shelves
OL,21,Fof stock'' into their clothes.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
